          > {formLoading ? '[RESETTING...]': '[RESET PASSWORD]'} </button> </div> </form> </div> </div> {/if} <!-- Session Revoke, Modal --> {#if showSessionModal && selectedSession} <div class="fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-75 flex items-center justify-center"> <div class="bg-gray-900 border-2 border-red-500 p-6 max-w-md w-full"> <div class="border-b border-red-500 pb-4"> <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">REVOKE SESSION</h2> </div> <div class="space-y-4"> <div class="bg-red-900/20 border border-red-500"> <p class="text-red-300 font-bold">CONFIRM REVOCATION</p> <p class="text-gray-300"> This will immediately terminate session {selectedSession.id.substring(0, 8)}... and log the user out. </p> </div> <form method="POST"
